OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity launches motorsport
OL,4,Adegrees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university is rolling out two
OL,7,Fmotorsport degrees and building new
OL,8,Ffacilities after securing a #1.6m
OL,9,Finvestment.
OL,11,FBournemouth University will launch the
OL,12,FBachelor of Engineering Motorsport
OL,13,FEngineering and Automotive engineering
OL,14,Fcourses, and build an advanced vehicle
OL,15,Fperformance centre at its Talbot
OL,16,FCampus, from September next year.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
