OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity launches motorsport
OL,4,Adegrees
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Christos Gatzidis, Pro Vice
OL,7,FChancellor Dean for the Faculty of
OL,8,FMedia, Science and Technology, said
OL,9,Fthey would "enable students to graduate
OL,10,Fready to build their careers in
OL,11,Findustries where engineering skills are
OL,12,Fin high demand".
OL,14,FThe investment was secured from the
OL,15,FOffice for Students (OfS) through a
OL,16,Fcompetitive process.
